<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT WEST INDIES BY EIGHT WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT WEST INDIES BY EIGHT WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat West Indies by eight wickets in a World Series limited overs match at the Sydney Cricket Ground on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores - West Indies 161 all out in 48.3 overs (Shane Warne five for 33); Australia 162 for two in 42 overs.</p>
